From: CB1 Project
Subject: [PATCH] drm/nvkms: retain native Pascal 422-10 for player-led DV

Keep the existing RGB8 carrier and expose native RGB10-to-42210 only when
NVKMS proves the HDMI engine and receiver support it. Reuse vendor BT.2020
CSC with no transfer function, static metadata or depth/format downgrade.
Check the final mode before any hardware mutation and expose effective
NVKMS readback separately from the DRM request. Preserve R580 userspace ABI.

